dsh-a2ui
========

This plugin implements the Agent-to-User Interface (A2UI) version 1.0 wire
protocol for DeepSeek Harness.

A2UI specification and catalogs
-------------------------------
The protocol implemented here is the A2UI 1.0 specification published by the
A2UI project (https://a2ui.org/, https://github.com/a2ui-project/a2ui).

    Copyright 2024 Google LLC
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

No source code from the A2UI project is copied into this package. The wire
format, message names, component property names, catalog identifiers, and
function signatures were read from the official v1.0 schemas and catalog
definitions shipped in `@a2ui/web_core@0.15.0` (Apache-2.0) and re-expressed
as an independent validator and renderer. The catalog id
`https://a2ui.org/specification/v1_0/catalogs/basic/catalog.json` and the
component/function names it defines are therefore attributed here.

DeepSeek Harness
----------------
This package is a plugin for DeepSeek Harness (https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)
and uses only its public extension points: the tool registry, the
system-prompt section registry, the Client slot registry, the locale service,
and the Session Conversation service. No Harness source code is modified or
vendored.

Third-party code
----------------
None. The runtime has no dependencies beyond `react`, which the Harness Client
provides through its module table.
